OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACan London build the homes it
OL,4,Aneeds?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo say London faces a housing challenge
OL,7,Fis like pointing out it has been hot
OL,8,Fthis summer.
OL,10,FEveryone knows it, everyone has been
OL,11,Ftalking about it for ages and everyone
OL,12,Fhas their own ideas about how to deal
OL,13,Fwith it.
OL,15,FSo will this week's government
OL,16,Fannouncement of funding for a new
OL,17,Faffordable homes programme be the start
OL,18,Fof the solution, or the latest in a
OL,19,Fline of ambitious attempts from
OL,20,Fgovernments of all colours to address
OL,21,Fthe issue?
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
